# Gitignored files a fresh worktree needs copied in from the main checkout.
#
# Treat this as the authoritative LIST of what to copy when creating a
# worktree -- no automation acts on it; the copy is a manual creation step.
#
# These are Bridgetown static sites with no encrypted credentials, so there is
# nothing secret to copy (and nothing like a Rails production.key that must
# never be copied). The list is intentionally empty.
#
# A fresh worktree does still need its dependencies installed per site:
#
#   for s in LeeAtchison TheSoftwareConductor stosa BusinessBreakthrough30 \
#            ArchitectingForScale AtchisonAcademy; do
#     (cd "$s" && bundle install && npm install)
#   done
